  "rationale": "tooltip:do_tip freed metro slot i (its position in the tooltip list, always 1) instead of the metro's own id. After the second tooltip, the tooltip timer reused the autosave metro's slot; do_autosave then stopped that shared metro, so the Autosaved tooltip never expired (and a tooltip in the 0.5 s before an autosave could cancel it). The tooltip now frees its own metro id.",
